comment10.params=
comment10.target=void\ shouldOrderIfLidAndCupHaveTheSameSize()
comment10.text=\n\ Verifica\ que\ al\ tener\ tapa\ y\ taza\ con\ mismo\ tama\u00F1o,\ ordena\ la\ torre\ (la\ taza\ debe\ ir\ primero).\ \n
comment11.params=
comment11.target=void\ shouldStayInTheirOriginalPosition()
comment11.text=\n\ Verifica\ que\ al\ realizar\ la\ reversa\ dos\ veces,\ las\ tazas\ y\ tapas\ est\u00E9n\ en\ su\ posici\u00F3n\ original.\n
comment12.params=
comment12.target=void\ shouldNotSwapBetweenIfItemsDoesntExists()
comment12.text=\n\ Verifica\ que\ no\ se\ pueda\ intercambiar\ entre\ un\ item\ existente\ y\ uno\ que\ no\ existe.\n
comment13.params=
comment13.target=void\ shouldCoverCupWithLid()
comment13.text=\n\ Verifica\ que\ no\ se\ tapen\ dos\ o\ m\u00E1s\ tapas.\n\ Verifica\ que\ se\ pueda\ cubrir\ una\ taza\ con\ una\ tapa.\n
comment14.params=
comment14.target=void\ shouldReturnEmptyListIfCupDoesntExists()
comment14.text=\n\ Verifica\ que\ se\ retorne\ una\ lista\ vac\u00EDa\ de\ una\ taza\ al\ no\ existir.\n
comment15.params=
comment15.target=void\ shouldReturnNothingIfItemsDoesntExists()
comment15.text=\n\ Verifica\ que\ no\ se\ retorne\ la\ matriz\ si\ los\ items\ no\ existen.\n
