comment2.target=void\ shouldStartWithHeightZero()
comment2.text=\n\ Verifica\ que\ la\ altura\ de\ la\ torre\ sea\ de\ 0cm.\n\ Verifica\ que\ al\ instanciar\ un\ objeto,\ la\ altura\ de\ la\ torre\ sea\ de\ 0cm.\n
comment3.params=
comment3.target=void\ shouldHeightIncreaseCorrectly()
comment3.text=\n\ La\ altura\ de\ la\ torre\ debe\ incrementar\ de\ forma\ correcta.\n
