comment6.target=void\ shouldDecreaseHeight()
comment6.text=\n\ Verifica\ que\ la\ taza\ a\ la\ que\ se\ desee\ eliminar,\ la\ altura\ de\ la\ torre\ se\ reduzca.\n
comment7.params=
comment7.target=void\ shouldIncreaseHeight()
comment7.text=\n\ Verifica\ que\ el\ tama\u00F1o\ de\ la\ tapa\ no\ sea\ mayor\ a\ 1cm.\n\ Verifica\ que\ la\ altura\ de\ la\ torre\ aumente\ al\ agregarle\ una\ tapa.\n
